AccountFactoryV3 / AccountV3Initializable
├── immutable deployment profile
│   ├── missing code / mismatched EntryPoint -> reject constructor
│   ├── changed implementation, linked library or senderCreator code -> reject creation
│   └── EntryPoint codehash -> constructor capture plus manifest admission, never validation EXTCODE
├── creator is not pinned senderCreator -> reject even valid proofs
├── identity or deployment differs from signed commitment -> reject
├── account does not exist
│   ├── wrong scope, time window, signer index or possession -> rollback CREATE2
│   ├── direct/rogue proxy -> reject canonical authorization/context
│   ├── every initial signer proves consent -> one-time install
│   ├── prefunded native/ERC20 -> preserve balances on success and rejection
│   ├── same deployment inputs on two local chain IDs -> same address/code
│   └── chain or authorization window differs -> require a new signature
├── implementation/direct initializer -> locked
├── account already exists
│   ├── code, implementation or immutable identity differs -> reject
│   └── same creation identity after rotation -> return without writes
└── single active consumer WebAuthn -> spend/admin after successful creation
